{"id":"db62358c2ba471b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-differential-form.md","title":"Differential Form","display":"df-differential-form — Differential Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differential-form","aliases":["58-df-differential-form","Differential Form","Exterior Form"],"display":"df-differential-form — Differential Form","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differential-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differential-form</span><span>Differential Form</span><span>Exterior Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differential-form — Differential Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"12045dd8fa450631\" href=\"?note=12045dd8fa450631\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,M\\in V\">\\(\\eta,M\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S\\)</span> 保留四元存在光滑结构接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,k)\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,k)\\)</span> 使用书内 <code>58-df-smooth-tensor-data</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span> 在一次调用中固定。</li>\n<li>原下游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(p)(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})\">\\(\\eta(p)(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})\\)</span> 采用交替多线性函数求值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(p)\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\eta(p)\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>。不把带点标签的丛总空间元素与其纤维多线性函数混用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,k)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,k)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留光滑交替协变张量的数学对象及四元接口；不再依赖未定义的丛截面 C∞ 记号或把不交并元素当作纤维函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bott and Tu, Differential Forms in Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":